---
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy | Hey! Another Driving School"
	description="How Hey! Another Driving School collects, uses and protects your personal information under South Africa's POPIA, and how to exercise your rights."
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
		<a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:underline">
			&larr; Back to home
		</a>

		<h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: 6 November 2026</p>

		<div class="mt-10 space-y-10 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground [&_h2]:mb-3 [&_h2]:text-2xl [&_h2]:font-bold [&_h2]:text-foreground [&_a]:font-medium [&_a]:text-foreground [&_a]:underline [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-2 [&_ul]:pl-6">
			<section>
				<p>
					Hey! Another Driving School ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what
					personal information we collect through <strong>jhbdrivingschool.co.za</strong>, why we
					collect it, who it is shared with, and your rights under the Protection of Personal
					Information Act 4 of 2013 (POPIA).
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Who is responsible for your information</h2>
				<p>
					Hey! Another Driving School, Jukskei Park, Johannesburg, Gauteng. You can contact us at
					<a href="mailto:info@jhbdrivingschool.co.za">info@jhbdrivingschool.co.za</a>, or phone
					Jacques on <a href="tel:+27829502858">082 950 2858</a> or Sharon on
					<a href="tel:+27711833500">071 183 3500</a>.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>What we collect</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>Callback request form:</strong> your name, email address and phone number, and
						a record that you agreed to this policy when you submitted the form.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Phone, WhatsApp and email:</strong> whatever you choose to tell us when you
						contact us directly.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Website analytics (only if you accept):</strong> anonymous information about how
						the site is used, such as pages viewed, device type, approximate location and which
						phone or WhatsApp links are tapped. This uses Google Analytics cookies.
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Why we collect it</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>To call or message you back about driving lessons, availability and pricing.</li>
					<li>To arrange and manage lessons and test bookings if you become a student.</li>
					<li>To understand which parts of the website are useful, so we can improve it.</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-3">We do not sell your information and we do not use it for unrelated marketing.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Who we share it with</h2>
				<p>We use a few service providers to run the website. They only handle your information to provide their service to us:</p>
				<ul class="mt-3">
					<li><strong>Web3Forms</strong> receives callback form submissions and forwards them to us by email.</li>
					<li><strong>ImprovMX</strong> forwards emails sent to our business address to our inboxes.</li>
					<li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> provides website statistics, only if you accept analytics cookies.</li>
					<li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> hosts the website and may log technical data such as IP addresses.</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-3">
					Some of these providers store data outside South Africa. We only use providers that
					protect personal information to a standard comparable to POPIA.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Cookies</h2>
				<p>
					The site only sets analytics cookies if you choose <strong>Accept</strong> on the notice at
					the bottom of the page. If you choose <strong>Decline</strong>, no analytics cookies are
					stored. You can change your mind at any time using "Cookie settings" in the footer.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
				<p>
					We keep your details only for as long as we need them to respond to you and manage your
					lessons. Ask us to delete them sooner at any time.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>How we protect it</h2>
				<p>
					The website is served over HTTPS, callback requests are sent by email to the school only,
					and access to our inboxes is limited to the instructors.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Your rights</h2>
				<p>Under POPIA you may ask us to:</p>
				<ul class="mt-3">
					<li>tell you what personal information we hold about you;</li>
					<li>correct or update it;</li>
					<li>delete it, or stop using it; and</li>
					<li>withdraw your consent at any time.</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-3">
					Email <a href="mailto:info@jhbdrivingschool.co.za">info@jhbdrivingschool.co.za</a> and we
					will respond promptly. If you are unhappy with how we handle your information, you may also
					complain to the Information Regulator of South Africa at
					<a href="https://inforegulator.org.za" rel="noopener noreferrer">inforegulator.org.za</a>.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
				<p>If we change how we handle personal information, we will update this page and the date at the top.</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
